# ralph/ directory
#
# This directory holds Ralph's runtime files.
#
#   ralph/logs/      — session logs (gitignored — see .gitignore)
#   ralph/STOP.md    — drop this file to request a graceful stop (NOT gitignored)
#
# To stop a running Ralph session:
#   touch ralph/STOP.md
# or:
#   kill -TERM $(cat /tmp/ralph-careless.pid)
